# Only for the GitHub Packages route (see README → Alternativa: GitHub Packages).
# Installing from GitHub (npm install github:jorgeecarvajal/dale-design-system#vX.Y.Z)
# needs no .npmrc.
#
# GitHub Packages requires the npm scope to match the repo owner: @jorgeecarvajal while the
# repo lives in that account (package name @jorgeecarvajal/ui), or @dale if it moves to a
# "dale" organisation. Copy to the app's .npmrc and set GITHUB_TOKEN to a token with
# read:packages.
@jorgeecarvajal:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
